WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:09.580
Ever since I was a kid

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:11.400
I never really fit in

00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:12.960
no one understands me.

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:16.420
Hey Red, how are ya?

00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:18.400
Oh, I'm horrible.

00:00:18.940 --> 00:00:20.000
Mister Rare?

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:23.280
There seems to be a recurring issue here

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.520
Don't look Bobby, the anger might be contagious.

00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:33.960
He started it.

00:00:35.980 --> 00:00:37.980
Hurry! Something's comming.

00:00:39.060 --> 00:00:40.340
Greetings!

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:42.380
I am a pig!

00:00:42.380 --> 00:00:43.400
What's a pig?

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:46.640
Unbelivable!

00:00:46.640 --> 00:00:47.700
...not workin' not workin'...

00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:49.280
Uh! Where are we going?

00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:50.140
...not workin'...

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:53.520
"Sigh" - We practiced this a hundred times.

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:54.900
Give it to me!

00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:56.240
We're gonna come in again.

00:00:57.180 --> 00:00:59.780
These pigsurias are weird, am I right?!

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:01.240
I don't trust them!

00:01:01.320 --> 00:01:02.540
I think they're up to something!

00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:04.600
Your opinion is not needed!

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:06.120
Is that what I think it is?

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:07.520
Excuse me! Those are fragile, right,

00:01:07.640 --> 00:01:08.220
not yours!

00:01:08.240 --> 00:01:10.160
You note our guests here are welcome!

00:01:10.180 --> 00:01:11.980
And you're not asking basic questions!

00:01:11.980 --> 00:01:13.840
Doesn't anyone see whats going on here??

00:01:14.420 --> 00:01:16.420
The hole world is in danger!

00:01:16.420 --> 00:01:18.280
And it's up to us, to stop 'em.

00:01:18.280 --> 00:01:19.960
The pigs are stealing our eggs!!

00:01:19.960 --> 00:01:22.060
Set sail for piggy-island.

00:01:23.620 --> 00:01:26.340
You tried to tell us, but we didn't listen

00:01:26.340 --> 00:01:27.480
What do we do now?

00:01:27.480 --> 00:01:29.360
THAT is where they went

00:01:30.280 --> 00:01:32.840
and so THAT is where we're going.

00:01:33.320 --> 00:01:35.320
We're gonna get those eggs back. Come on!

00:01:35.320 --> 00:01:37.640
We're birds. We're descendants from dinosaurs.

00:01:37.640 --> 00:01:39.600
We're not supposed to be nice

00:01:41.220 --> 00:01:42.840
Hooooly Mooolly!

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:44.840
Yeah, point made.

00:01:45.900 --> 00:01:46.960
FIRE!

00:01:47.140 --> 00:01:48.420
That guy again.

00:01:48.420 --> 00:01:49.620
TAKE THAT PORKER!

00:01:50.320 --> 00:01:51.620
Well how about that

00:01:52.300 --> 00:01:54.300
she can shoot fireballs out of her butt.

00:01:54.500 --> 00:01:56.500
Call in the piggy-airforce!

00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:00.520
Ey, he's comming back.

00:02:02.960 --> 00:02:04.960
Aaaah - Did we win?

00:02:05.840 --> 00:02:09.120
Remember: the goal is the Castle. Get to the Castle!

00:02:09.120 --> 00:02:10.840
Am I get a running staaaaaaart...

00:02:10.840 --> 00:02:12.400
... I wasn't reeeeady!!!!

00:02:20.880 --> 00:02:22.880
Jock! Is that you?

00:02:22.880 --> 00:02:24.680
This is a house of Horror.

